# The sprite pipeline's output, which only `with/pixi-js` generates.
#
# Listed HERE, on a base that has no pipeline, on purpose. A checkout that has
# been on that branch leaves these behind, and without this they show up as
# untracked files and fail `format:check` on a generated manifest - a false red
# in a gate, which is the thing that teaches people to stop reading gates. It
# also keeps `.gitignore` off the branch's shared-file edit list (rule N1).
static/assets
src/lib/manifest.json
.assetpack
